ay light stop signs or a flashing  crosswalk would all help them feel safer  on this street and clark county says  that this is a tragic accident and they  will be studying this intersection to  see if any changes are warranted  reporting live from las vegas boulevard  and silverado ranch kate houston live  local now
 

